---
import InternalLayout from '../../layouts/InternalLayout.astro';
---

<InternalLayout title="Clinical Supervision | Evolve Counseling & Wellness">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-24">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <h1 class="font-playfair text-4xl md:text-5xl text-[hsl(var(--foreground))]">
        Clinical Supervision
      </h1>
      
      <div class="w-12 h-1 bg-[hsl(var(--primary))]"></div>

      <div class="prose prose-lg text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] leading-relaxed font-light max-w-none">
        <p>
          Supervision is more than just a box to check—it’s a space for reflection, growth, and deepening your identity as a clinician. I offer individual clinical supervision for pre-licensed and licensed therapists in Texas, Washington, Oregon, and Hawaii who are working with adult individuals and who value a systemic, humanistic lens in their work.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] mt-10 mb-4">
          My Approach
        </h2>
        <p>
          My clinical supervision approach mirrors my approach to therapy: relational, insight-oriented, and rooted in curiosity and mutual respect. I’m not here to tell you how to be a therapist—I’m here to support your unfolding as one. I focus on who you are in the room, how your personal experiences intersect with your professional work, and how to build a sustainable, grounded practice that’s truly your own.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] mt-10 mb-4">
          My Experience
        </h2>
        <p>
          My 12 years of supervisory experience includes 6 years of leadership as a clinical supervisor for a multidisciplinary mental health team in a community health setting. During that time, I also had the pleasure of supervising graduate-level interns across disciplines—including Marriage and Family Therapy, Mental Health Counseling, and Social Work. While I am trained as an LMFT, my clinical focus is now centered primarily on individual therapy. I enjoy working with clinicians who value and would like to cultivate a truly systemic framework in their one-on-one client work.
        </p>

        <h2 class="font-playfair text-2xl text-[hsl(var(--foreground))] mt-10 mb-4">
          Is This The Right Fit?
        </h2>
        <p>
          If you’re looking for a supervision space focused primarily on technical outcomes, productivity, or a specific ideological orientation, I may not be the right fit—and that’s okay. If, however, you’re seeking a supervision experience that honors your full humanity, invites self-reflection, and supports your growth both personally and professionally, I would love to connect.
        </p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-[hsl(var(--border))]">
        <a href="https://evolve-wellness.clientsecure.me/contact-widget" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-block px-8 py-4 text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider uppercase rounded bg-[hsl(var(--primary))] text-[hsl(var(--primary-foreground))] hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity shadow-md">
          Contact Me
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</InternalLayout>